  <p>Independent cleaning opportunities · Calgary</p>
  <h1>Experienced cleaner?<br>Let's talk.</h1>
  <p>Elite Clean Pro is building a network of independent cleaners and small cleaning businesses for residential and move-out work in Calgary. Tell us about your experience, the areas you cover and your availability.</p>
  <h2>Start with a short introduction</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your name or cleaning business name, and the best way to contact you.</li>
    <li>Your paid cleaning experience and the services you offer.</li>
    <li>The Calgary neighbourhoods you cover and your usual availability.</li>
    <li>The equipment, supplies and transportation you use for your work.</li>
    <li>Whether you work independently or with a small team.</li>
  </ul>
  <a class="partner-cta" href="mailto:hello@elitecleanpro.ca?subject=Independent%20cleaner%20introduction">Introduce yourself by email →</a>
  <p>If the email link does not open, write to <a href="mailto:hello@elitecleanpro.ca">hello@elitecleanpro.ca</a> with the subject “Independent cleaner introduction”.</p>
  <h2>What happens next</h2>
  <p>We review introductions and contact potential matches to discuss experience, references, service scope and availability. Compensation, payment timing, equipment responsibilities and any trial work must be agreed before work begins.</p>
  <p class="partner-note">This is an expression of interest in independent business opportunities. It does not guarantee work, hours, earnings or an engagement. Please do not email government ID, banking details or customer access codes with your introduction.</p>
